Find the electric field at a height $z$ above the center of a square sheet (side length $a$) carrying a uniform surface charge $sigma$. Check your result for the limiting cases $a arrow infinity$ and $z >> a$. [Answer: $(sigma/(2 epsilon_0)){(4/pi) tan^(-1) sqrt(1 + a^2/(2 z^2)) - 1}$.]
